        <obo:IAO_0000115>The luminal epithelium of the tube that conducts the urine from the renal pelvis to the bladder[MP].</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000012>MP treats ureter urothelium and ureter luminal urothelium as exact synonyms, yes MA treats these as distinct; see also: transitional epithelium vs urothelium</obo:UBPROP_0000012>
