        <obo:UBPROP_0000001>One of two or three twisted curved tubules in each lobule of the testis in which spermatogenesis occurs. [TFD][VHOG]</obo:UBPROP_0000001>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000003>Frogs among amphibians and the amniotes have males with testes that are composed of seminiferous tubules, which differ from ampullae in being long, highly convoluted ductules.[well established][VHOG]</obo:UBPROP_0000003>
