        <oboInOwl:external_class>VHOG:0001278</oboInOwl:external_class>
        <oboInOwl:ontology>VHOG</oboInOwl:ontology>
        <oboInOwl:source>DOI:10.1021/pr050213t Parada C, Gato A, Bueno D, Mammalian embryonic cerebrospinal fluid proteome has greater apolipoprotein and enzyme pattern complexity than the avian proteome. Journal of Proteome Research (2005)</oboInOwl:source>
