        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>arteria subclavia</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>arterial tree of upper limb</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>pectoral artery</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
