        <owl:annotatedTarget>The group of sensory neuron cell bodies associated with the facial nerve (seventh cranial nerve).</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ISBN:0-683-40008-8</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
