        <owl:annotatedTarget>The muscular, non-bony arch-shaped posterior portion of the palate extending from the posterior edge of the hard palate.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>GO:0060023</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>UBERON:cjm</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
