        <obo:UBPROP_0000008>In humans: 15% orthokeratinized, 75% parakeratinized, 10% non-keratinized; diurnal; decreased keratinization with age. Note that in FMA this is classified as keratinized squamous - this perhaps refers to the epithelium of the attached or free gingiva</obo:UBPROP_0000008>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>BTO:0004998</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FMA:62423</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
