        <obo:IAO_0000115>A valve at the opening of the sinus venosus into the primordial atrium[TFD,modified].</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000232>in humans and mouse this is the opening from SV into right atrium. This class represents the valve connecting the SV to any atrium and is applicable to animals with a single atrium</obo:IAO_0000232>
