        <obo:IAO_0000115>A bronchiole that is the first segment of the respiratory zone.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000008>mice have few or none of these structures, with the terminal bronchioles transitioning directly to the alveolary ducts</obo:UBPROP_0000008>
