        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/uberon/core#vertebrate_core"/>
        <rdfs:comment>defined generically so could in theory encompass FBbt:00003260 &apos;skeletal muscle of head&apos;, or the muscle of a starfish Aristotle&apos;s lantern, but we restrict this to craniates. Skeletal muscles of the head originate from the non-segmented head mesoderm (Noden, 1983; Wachtler et al., 1984)</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>cranial muscle</rdfs:label>
