        <obo:IAO_0000115>Bone tissue that has a lattice-like or spongy structure; it is highly vascular and contains intercommunicating spaces filled with bone marrow.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>BTO:0001700</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>CALOHA:TS-0110</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
