        <obo:IAO_0000115>Portion of tissue that is part of the anterior neural keel and will form the optic vesicle[ZFA]. A paired ectodermal placode that becomes invaginated to form the embryonic lens vesicles.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000012>TODO - check that GO&apos;s optic placode is the same as ZFA&apos;s eye primordium; we may want to have separate term for ocular primordium precursor. XAO has both optic field and eye primordium.</obo:UBPROP_0000012>
