        <obo:IAO_0000115>Subdivision of skeletal system that consists of all ribs in an organism connected to the sternum and the vertebrae. Some vertebrates have abdominal ribs (gastrialia), not connected to the vertebrate - these are not considered part of the rib case.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000001>Anatomical cluster that consists of more than one rib in an individual.[TAO]</obo:UBPROP_0000001>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FMA:7480</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
