            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The polygonal structure of the liver that consists of hepatocytes radiating outward from a hepatic vein.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000232>should not be confused with the anatomic lobes of the liver (caudate lobe, quadrate lobe, left lobe, and right lobe), or any of the functional lobe classification systems.[WP]</obo:IAO_0000232>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>EMAPA:35499</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FMA:14471</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
