        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBPROP_0000011"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>produced along the length of the embryonic mammary ridge these buds represent the future locations of the mammary glands. Invagination of ectoderm at each bud leads to the development of epithelial diverticula, later maturing as lactiferous ducts</owl:annotatedTarget>
