        <obo:IAO_0000115>A vein that returns blood from the intestines.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000008>In humans the inferior mesenteric vein empties into the splenic vein, the superior mesenteric vein joins the splenic vein to form the portal vein</obo:UBPROP_0000008>
