            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The outermost layer of the superior colliculus.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>grouping teleost assuming homology of superior colliculus and optic tectum; however, this is dubious as tectal layers vary so widely. See: http://icb.oxfordjournals.org/content/42/4/743/T1.expansion.html</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>BM:MB-Tec-SCS</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
