        <obo:IAO_0000115>An embryonic structure that will either develop into a post-anal tail or recede into a vestigial remnant of the tail.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000011>By the fourth week a clear tail is seen in the human embryo. It recedes after a few weeks and these tissues form what is commonly known as the tailbone (coccyx).</obo:UBPROP_0000011>
