        <owl:annotatedTarget>a long process of a CNS neuron, that carries efferent (outgoing) action potentials from the cell body in the spinal cord towards target cells in the thalamus. This axonal process is a member of those that make up the spinothalamic tract, one of the major routes of nociceptive signaling[GO][GO:0021963].</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:source>GO:0021963</oboInOwl:source>
    </owl:Axiom>
