        <owl:annotatedTarget>An arch-shaped structure of the vertebra that extends dorsally (neural arch) or ventrally (hemal arch) from the vertebral centrum.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>http://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
