        <obo:IAO_0000115>A bone that is part of a pelvic complex. Examples: pubis, ischium, fot phalanx, any tarsal bone, any bone of the pelvic fin or girdle.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000012>the MA class called &apos;hindlimb bone&apos; belongs here, as it includes bones in the pelvic girdle</obo:UBPROP_0000012>
