        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any member of the network of tubes that return blood from the renal tissues to the systemic circulation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000012>we follow MA and MP in distinguishing the venous blood vessel from the vein. The kidney cortex vein is not considered a renal vein, nor is the vasa recta</obo:UBPROP_0000012>
