        <obo:IAO_0000115>A collagenous capsule covering the external surface of the liver.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000010>It consists of type III collagen and extends to the stroma of endothelial sinusoids. It is covered by a single layer of mesothelial cells.</obo:UBPROP_0000010>
