        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An embryonic structure positioned halfway between the prospective eye and ear, adjacent to the future midbrain-hindbrain boundary. The profundal and the trigeminal ganglia are separate distally but fused at their proximal end as they condense around NF stage 24.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>XAO:0004093</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>ophthalmic lobe of trigeminal placode</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
